# sentry - floating mine-orb. 16x16, 2 frames, straight top-down, faces down (radially symmetric).
# light: top-left. Outline: K exterior only; four stub spikes run into the 12px shell without a seam.
# Palette: olive hull b c d e, red core m n r p, K (9 colours). Smallest feature: red core 4x4 inside a 1px ring.
# Frames: 0 dim (core n/r, ring m), 1 flare (core r/p, ring n). 250 ms each, loop. Only core pixels change.
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a  outline
b #31443a  olive-1
c #4f6852  olive-2
d #7e9a78  olive-3
e #b9cfa2  olive-4
m #4c0f24  red-0
n #92203a  red-1
r #da3d4f  red-2
p #ff8a86  red-3 glint
